      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "text": "GATED FALLBACK - EVIDENCE REQUIRED\nOption 1: required grain, limited relationships or Excel tests still fail after tuning.\nOption 2: required cache / refresh cannot fit, or critical queries cannot hit aggregates.\nBoth must fail agreed criteria for a capacity-solvable reason; a stuck copy is not one.",
      "originalText": "GATED FALLBACK - EVIDENCE REQUIRED\nOption 1: required grain, limited relationships or Excel tests still fail after tuning.\nOption 2: required cache / refresh cannot fit, or critical queries cannot hit aggregates.\nBoth must fail agreed criteria for a capacity-solvable reason; a stuck copy is not one.",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "03-scale-fallback-fallback-gate",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "autoResize": false,
      "customData": {
        "role": "bound-label"
      }
